    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 472.1pt; border-collapse: collapse; \" border=\"0\" width=\"629\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 3.5pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.8pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center; page-break-after: avoid;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Number of <span style=\"\">fields<sup>a</sup></span></span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 182.65pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"244\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center; page-break-after: avoid;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Grade (3-tier system)</span></strong> <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{1260722}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 182.65pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"244\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center; page-break-after: avoid;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Grade (2-tier system) </span></strong><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{7814189}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"\">&le;&nbsp;1</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 182.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"244\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Grade&nbsp;1</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 182.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"244\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Low-grade</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"\"><span style=\"color: black; \">&gt;&nbsp;1 to &le;&nbsp;3</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 182.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"244\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Grade&nbsp;2</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 182.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"244\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; \">High-grade</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.8pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"\">&gt;&nbsp;3</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 182.65pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"244\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Grade&nbsp;3</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 182.65pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"244\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">High-grade</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><sup><span style=\"\">a</span></sup><span style=\"\">The</span> grading of immature teratoma is based on the number of low-power microscopic fields (4.5&nbsp;mm in diameter, &times;40 total magnification) containing aggregated amounts of immature neuroectoderm in any one slide.</p>",
